{"id":"internacional","lemma":"internacional","pos":"adj","rank":2105,"glosses":["international"],"ipa":"/inteɾnaθjoˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"internacionales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-internacional.wav","examples":[{"text":"El problema de la droga es internacional.","en":"The drug problem is international.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707762","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"problem"},null,null,{"g":"drug"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"El inglés es una lengua internacional.","en":"English is an international language.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567821","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"English"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tongue"},null]},{"text":"La situación internacional se está poniendo grave.","en":"The international situation is becoming grave.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"serious, grave"}]},{"text":"Dijeron que fue una clara violación de la ley internacional.","en":"They said it was a clear violation of international law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733673","words":[{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"the white"},{"g":"violation"},null,null,{"g":"law"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"No deberíamos recurrir a las armas para resolver los conflictos internacionales.","en":"We should not resort to arms to settle international disputes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693406","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to resort to"},null,null,null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to resolve"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"conflict","l":"conflicto"},null],"phrases":[[3,6,"to arms!"]]}]}